{"3930090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BRESH", "steam_appid": 3930090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRESH</strong> is a tactical first-person shooter built around instant teleportation between two parallel worlds — triggered at the press of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves, hide, deceive. Shift reality mid-fight. Victory comes not just from aim, but from awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traverse both worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting contrasts two realities:<br>a decaying, post-Soviet wasteland and a prosperous Russia of the near future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the geometry of both to flank, escape, ambush — or disappear entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tree core modes: classic deathmatch, team deathmatch and bomb planting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two unique maps with layered, mirrored architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization of both characters and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you <strong>can accidentally split yourself in half</strong> — or do it to someone else</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual style inspired by Russian environments and atmosphere</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRESH</strong> is a tactical first-person shooter built around instant teleportation between two parallel worlds — triggered at the press of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves, hide, deceive. Shift reality mid-fight. Victory comes not just from aim, but from awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traverse both worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting contrasts two realities:<br>a decaying, post-Soviet wasteland and a prosperous Russia of the near future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the geometry of both to flank, escape, ambush — or disappear entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tree core modes: classic deathmatch, team deathmatch and bomb planting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two unique maps with layered, mirrored architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization of both characters and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you <strong>can accidentally split yourself in half</strong> — or do it to someone else</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual style inspired by Russian environments and atmosphere</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "BRESH is a tactical FPS with teleportation between two universes. Think on two levels. Hide and outsmart. Customize your gear and appearance.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930090/1c51ec1f3bc2a2cfe8bb0ee47c62ded715444065/header.jpg?t=1763550014", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930090/2b8def69252b68d2b70231afb02a4d9df0ed0db9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763550014", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930090/2b8def69252b68d2b70231afb02a4d9df0ed0db9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763550014", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 640 / AMD Radeon R7 240<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Vladislav Surin", "Daniel Prol1xy"], "publishers": ["Destroevi4"], "demos": [